          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Check belt length, continuous motor rating and weight capacity
            first.</strong> Those three decide whether a walking pad suits you and how long it
